    "<div>\n        <div>\n          <span>Phần B</span>\n          <h3>PART B: LANGUAGE FOCUS (2.6 pts)</h3>\n        </div>\n        <span>Pronunciation, Grammar &amp; Vocabulary</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <!-- Section I: Pronunciation -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            I. Choose the word whose underlined part is pronounced differently from the rest. Circle A, B, C or D to indicate your answer. (0.2 p)\n          </h4>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section III: Multiple Choice Questions 3-10 -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            II. Choose the best answer A, B, C or D to complete the sentences. (1,6 pts)\n          </h4>\n          <div>\n            <!-- Q3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q5 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q6 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q7 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q8 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q9 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q10 -->\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section IV: Supply the correct tense or form of the verb -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            IV. Supply the correct tense or form of the verb in parentheses. (0.6 pts)\n          </h4>\n          <div>\n            <!-- V1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- V2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- V3 -->\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>",
    "<div>\n        <div>\n          <span>Phần C</span>\n          <h3>PART C: READING (2.5 pts)</h3>\n        </div>\n        <span>Reading Comprehension</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <!-- Passage 1: Cloze test -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            I. Choose the correct word A, B, C or D for each gap to complete the following passage. (1.0 p)\n          </h4>\n\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              There are a lot of pastimes that young people like, and one of <strong>(1)</strong> _______________ is mountain climbing. It is an active leisure activity that people can do either indoors or outdoors. If you go climbing outdoors, it is a great way to <strong>(2)</strong> _______________ your strength and enjoy nature at the same time. You can even set up your own climbing wall in your backyard or inside your home. This way you don’t have to go out and still can <strong>(3)</strong> _______________ fit and enjoy the activity.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              So how can you start mountain climbing? Many people take a class to learn how to climb and use their equipment <strong>(4)</strong> _______________. Others join climbing clubs to make new friends with the same interest and go climbing together. If you are an active person and like outdoor activities, <strong>(5)</strong> _______________ don’t you try this activity?\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <!-- C1_1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C1_2 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C1_3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C1_4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C1_5 -->\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Passage 2: Country Life vs City Life -->\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            II. Read the following passage and do the task below:\n          </h4>\n\n          <div>\n            <p>\n              The thing I like most about living on a farm when I was small was the change of seasons spring summer, autumn and winter. I could see the change all come and go and each one was completely different. If hadn't been born and raised in the country, I would have never been able to tell the difference. Now in the city. you can buy summer flowers in winter and eat the same vegetables all the year round. Whereas, in the country I could only eat things at certain times of the year. For example, strawberries in June and turnips in winter lived my childhood with the seasons.\n            </p>\n            <p>\n              Also we made most of our food and would never eat frozen or tinned food. Everything was fresh, so it must be better than the type of food I am taking now in the city. City people think that people in the country miss a lot of good things about modern life, but in my opinion they miss a lot more than them. They miss real life.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- A/ Choose the best answer -->\n          <div>\n            <h5>A/ Choose the best answer. (0,4pt)</h5>\n\n            <!-- C2_A1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- C2_A2 -->\n            \n          </div>\n\n          <!-- B/ Answer the questions -->\n          <div>\n            <h5>B/ Answer the questions. (1.2 pt)</h5>\n\n            <!-- Q3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- Q5 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>",
